#: kwindecoration.cpp:308
msgid ""
"<H3>No Configurable Options Available</H3>"
"Sorry, no configurable options are available for the currently selected "
"decoration."
msgstr ""
"<H3>nee konfigureerbaar opsies beskikbaar</H3>jammer, nee konfigureerbaar "
"opsies word beskikbaar vir die huidiglik gekose versiering."

#: kwindecoration.cpp:459
msgid ""
"<h1>Window Manager Decoration</h1>This module allows you to choose the "
"window border decorations, as well as titlebar button positions and custom "
"decoration options."
msgstr ""
"<h1>venster bestuurder versiering</h1>hierdie module laat toe jy aan kies "
"die venster grens versierings, as goed as titelbar knoppie posisies en "
"pasmaak versiering opsies."

